<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:5.7pt;"></span>This pattern systematically guides the model from foundational technical knowledge to advanced applications, encouraging detailed and contextually rich responses at each stage. The prompts are designed to stimulate exploration of technical principles, real-world practices, and forward-thinking applications.</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</span></span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g></svg></span>
