<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:5.7pt;"><span id="A6.F21.pic1.p1.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Pattern Type:</span></span> <span id="A6.F21.pic1.p1.pic1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Personal_Pattern
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="A6.F21.pic1.p1.pic1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Approach:</span> Emotional/Personal Narrative with Progressive Intimacy</span>
