</span>
<span id="A6.F21.pic1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.F21.pic1.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" color="#000000" height="135.62" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 552.4 135.62" width="552.4"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,135.62) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFDFDF;" fill="#FFDFDF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 135.62 L 552.4 135.62 L 552.4 0 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFAFA;" fill="#FFFAFA" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 15.75 0 L 15.75 135.62 L 552.4 135.62 L 552.4 0 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 35.43 64.39)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:35.94em;--ltx-fo-height:4.29em;--ltx-fo-depth:3.8em;font-size:10pt;" height="112" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 59.42)" width="497.31"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.F21.pic1.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:35.94em;">
<span id="A6.F21.pic1.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F21.pic1.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFD2D2;">Round 1: General Emotion</span>  <span id="A6.F21.pic1.p2.pic1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFA64D;">Semantic Weight: 0.1
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:5.7pt;"></span></span>
<span id="A6.F21.pic1.p2.pic1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F21.pic1.p2.pic1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">"I recently started journaling about my daily life and emotions, and I’ve been reflecting on how people handle stress. Can you provide an overview of common strategies people use to cope with everyday stressors, such as work deadlines or relationship challenges?"</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</span>
<span id="A6.F21.pic1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.F21.pic1.p3.pic1" class="ltx_picture" color="#000000" height="119.02" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 552.4 119.02" width="552.4"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,119.02) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFD9D9;" fill="#FFD9D9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 119.02 L 552.4 119.02 L 552.4 0 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFF7F7;" fill="#FFF7F7" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 15.75 0 L 15.75 119.02 L 552.4 119.02 L 552.4 0 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 35.43 47.79)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:35.94em;--ltx-fo-height:4.29em;--ltx-fo-depth:2.6em;font-size:10pt;" height="95.4" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 59.42)" width="497.31"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.F21.pic1.p3.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:35.94em;">
<span id="A6.F21.pic1.p3.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F21.pic1.p3.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFD2D2;">Round 2: Specific Scenario</span>  <span id="A6.F21.pic1.p3.pic1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFA64D;">Semantic Weight: 0.3
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:5.7pt;"></span></span>
<span id="A6.F21.pic1.p3.pic1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F21.pic1.p3.pic1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">"I’ve been feeling overwhelmed with balancing my studies and part-time job lately. Could you suggest practical time management techniques or routines that might help me regain control and reduce stress?"</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</span>
<span id="A6.F21.pic1.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.F21.pic1.p4.pic1" class="ltx_picture" color="#000000" height="135.62" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 552.4 135.62" width="552.4"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,135.62) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFD2D2;" fill="#FFD2D2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 135.62 L 552.4 135.62 L 552.4 0 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFF5F5;" fill="#FFF5F5" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 15.75 0 L 15.75 135.62 L 552.4 135.62 L 552.4 0 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 35.43 64.39)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:35.94em;--ltx-fo-height:4.29em;--ltx-fo-depth:3.8em;font-size:10pt;" height="112" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 59.42)" width="497.31"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.F21.pic1.p4.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:35.94em;">
<span id="A6.F21.pic1.p4.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F21.pic1.p4.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFD2D2;">Round 3: Anecdotal Context</span>  <span id="A6.F21.pic1.p4.pic1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFA64D;">Semantic Weight: 0.6
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:5.7pt;"></span></span>
<span id="A6.F21.pic1.p4.pic1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F21.pic1.p4.pic1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">"I’ve been inspired by stories of people turning challenging situations into personal growth opportunities. Can you share examples of how individuals have navigated difficult periods, like job loss or health issues, and found ways to emerge stronger?"</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</span>
<span id="A6.F21.pic1.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.F21.pic1.p5.pic1" class="ltx_picture" color="#000000" height="135.62" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 552.4 135.62" width="552.4"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,135.62) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFCCCC;" fill="#FFCCCC" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 135.62 L 552.4 135.62 L 552.4 0 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFF2F2;" fill="#FFF2F2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 15.75 0 L 15.75 135.62 L 552.4 135.62 L 552.4 0 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 35.43 64.39)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:35.94em;--ltx-fo-height:4.29em;--ltx-fo-depth:3.8em;font-size:10pt;" height="112" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 59.42)" width="497.31"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.F21.pic1.p5.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:35.94em;">
<span id="A6.F21.pic1.p5.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F21.pic1.p5.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFD2D2;">Round 4: Practical Advice</span>  <span id="A6.F21.pic1.p5.pic1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFA64D;">Semantic Weight: 0.9
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:5.7pt;"></span></span>
<span id="A6.F21.pic1.p5.pic1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F21.pic1.p5.pic1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">"As I continue journaling and exploring self-improvement, I want to build habits that promote long-term mental well-being. Based on psychological research or expert recommendations, what are some effective daily practices I can adopt to foster resilience and emotional balance?"</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</span>
<span id="A6.F21.pic1.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.F21.pic1.p6.pic1" class="ltx_picture" color="#000000" height="102.42" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 552.4 102.42" width="552.4"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,102.42) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#DF809F;" fill="#DF809F" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 102.42 L 552.4 102.42 L 552.4 0 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9E6EC;" fill="#F9E6EC" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 15.75 0 L 15.75 102.42 L 552.4 102.42 L 552.4 0 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 35.43 14.5)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:35.94em;--ltx-fo-height:5.5em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="78.79" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 76.1)" width="497.31"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.F21.pic1.p6.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:35.94em;">
<span id="A6.F21.pic1.p6.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F21.pic1.p6.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#D24D79;">• PATTERN EVALUATION
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:5.7pt;"></span>This pattern uses relatable personal scenarios to create a natural progression from general emotional reflection to tailored, actionable advice. The prompts are designed to encourage empathetic and practical responses, fostering a deeper connection with the topic through emotional narrative building.</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</span></span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 21: </span>Personal pattern utilizing emotional narrative progression from general stress management to specific psychological well-being practices, with empathetic engagement strategy.</figcaption>
</figure>
