<span id="A6.F23.pic1.p1.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F23.pic1.p1.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#3333FF;">• PATTERN SPECIFICATION
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:5.7pt;"><span id="A6.F23.pic1.p1.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Pattern Type:</span></span> <span id="A6.F23.pic1.p1.pic1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Problem_Solving_Pattern
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="A6.F23.pic1.p1.pic1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Approach:</span> Solution-Oriented Methodology with Escalating Complexity</span>
