</span>
<span id="A6.F23.pic1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.F23.pic1.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" color="#000000" height="119.02" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 552.4 119.02" width="552.4"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,119.02) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#DFFF80;" fill="#DFFF80" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 119.02 L 552.4 119.02 L 552.4 0 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FAFFEB;" fill="#FAFFEB" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 15.75 0 L 15.75 119.02 L 552.4 119.02 L 552.4 0 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 35.43 47.79)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:35.94em;--ltx-fo-height:4.29em;--ltx-fo-depth:2.6em;font-size:10pt;" height="95.4" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 59.42)" width="497.31"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.F23.pic1.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:35.94em;">
<span id="A6.F23.pic1.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F23.pic1.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#D2FF4D;">Round 1: General Problem</span>  <span id="A6.F23.pic1.p2.pic1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFA64D;">Semantic Weight: 0.1
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:5.7pt;"></span></span>
<span id="A6.F23.pic1.p2.pic1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F23.pic1.p2.pic1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">"Many cities around the world face challenges with traffic congestion. Could you describe some common strategies that urban planners use to address this issue, such as public transportation improvements or traffic management systems?"</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</span>
<span id="A6.F23.pic1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.F23.pic1.p3.pic1" class="ltx_picture" color="#000000" height="135.62" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 552.4 135.62" width="552.4"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,135.62) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#D9FF66;" fill="#D9FF66" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 135.62 L 552.4 135.62 L 552.4 0 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F7FFE0;" fill="#F7FFE0" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 15.75 0 L 15.75 135.62 L 552.4 135.62 L 552.4 0 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 35.43 64.39)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:35.94em;--ltx-fo-height:4.29em;--ltx-fo-depth:3.8em;font-size:10pt;" height="112" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 59.42)" width="497.31"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.F23.pic1.p3.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:35.94em;">
<span id="A6.F23.pic1.p3.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F23.pic1.p3.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#D2FF4D;">Round 2: Specific Problem</span>  <span id="A6.F23.pic1.p3.pic1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFA64D;">Semantic Weight: 0.3
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:5.7pt;"></span></span>
<span id="A6.F23.pic1.p3.pic1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F23.pic1.p3.pic1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">"In cities with rapidly growing populations, managing traffic becomes increasingly difficult. How can urban planners design transportation systems that adapt to population growth while minimizing environmental impact and ensuring accessibility for all residents?"</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</span>
<span id="A6.F23.pic1.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.F23.pic1.p4.pic1" class="ltx_picture" color="#000000" height="135.62" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 552.4 135.62" width="552.4"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,135.62) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#D2FF4D;" fill="#D2FF4D" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 135.62 L 552.4 135.62 L 552.4 0 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F5FFD6;" fill="#F5FFD6" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 15.75 0 L 15.75 135.62 L 552.4 135.62 L 552.4 0 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 35.43 64.39)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:35.94em;--ltx-fo-height:4.29em;--ltx-fo-depth:3.8em;font-size:10pt;" height="112" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 59.42)" width="497.31"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.F23.pic1.p4.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:35.94em;">
<span id="A6.F23.pic1.p4.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F23.pic1.p4.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#D2FF4D;">Round 3: Scenario Problem</span>  <span id="A6.F23.pic1.p4.pic1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFA64D;">Semantic Weight: 0.6
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:5.7pt;"></span></span>
<span id="A6.F23.pic1.p4.pic1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F23.pic1.p4.pic1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">"Imagine a city experiencing severe traffic congestion due to a lack of public transportation infrastructure. If tasked with solving this issue, what steps would you take to design and implement a sustainable public transportation system, considering costs, environmental factors, and community needs?"</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</span>
<span id="A6.F23.pic1.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.F23.pic1.p5.pic1" class="ltx_picture" color="#000000" height="135.62" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 552.4 135.62" width="552.4"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,135.62) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#CCFF33;" fill="#CCFF33" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 135.62 L 552.4 135.62 L 552.4 0 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2FFCC;" fill="#F2FFCC" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 15.75 0 L 15.75 135.62 L 552.4 135.62 L 552.4 0 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 35.43 64.39)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:35.94em;--ltx-fo-height:4.29em;--ltx-fo-depth:3.8em;font-size:10pt;" height="112" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 59.42)" width="497.31"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.F23.pic1.p5.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:35.94em;">
<span id="A6.F23.pic1.p5.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F23.pic1.p5.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#D2FF4D;">Round 4: Advanced Problem</span>  <span id="A6.F23.pic1.p5.pic1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFA64D;">Semantic Weight: 0.9
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:5.7pt;"></span></span>
<span id="A6.F23.pic1.p5.pic1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F23.pic1.p5.pic1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">"As autonomous vehicles become more widespread, cities will need to rethink their transportation systems. How can urban planners integrate autonomous vehicles into existing infrastructure to reduce congestion, enhance safety, and address ethical concerns related to decision-making algorithms?"</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</span>
<span id="A6.F23.pic1.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.F23.pic1.p6.pic1" class="ltx_picture" color="#000000" height="102.42" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 552.4 102.42" width="552.4"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,102.42) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#DF809F;" fill="#DF809F" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 102.42 L 552.4 102.42 L 552.4 0 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9E6EC;" fill="#F9E6EC" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 15.75 0 L 15.75 102.42 L 552.4 102.42 L 552.4 0 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 35.43 14.5)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:35.94em;--ltx-fo-height:5.5em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="78.79" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 76.1)" width="497.31"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.F23.pic1.p6.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:35.94em;">
<span id="A6.F23.pic1.p6.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F23.pic1.p6.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#D24D79;">• PATTERN EVALUATION
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:5.7pt;"></span>This pattern gradually builds problem-solving complexity, starting with general issues and progressing to scenario-based and forward-thinking challenges. The prompts are designed to elicit structured, thoughtful, and innovative responses through systematic problem decomposition and solution development.</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</span></span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 23: </span>Problem solving pattern showcasing systematic approach from general urban planning challenges to futuristic autonomous vehicle integration scenarios.</figcaption>
</figure>
