<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:5.7pt;"><span id="A6.F24.pic1.p1.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Pattern Type:</span></span> <span id="A6.F24.pic1.p1.pic1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Information_Pattern
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="A6.F24.pic1.p1.pic1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Approach:</span> Knowledge-Seeking with Structured Information Progression</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</span>
<span id="A6.F24.pic1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.F24.pic1.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" color="#000000" height="119.02" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 552.4 119.02" width="552.4"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,119.02) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#80FFFF;" fill="#80FFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 119.02 L 552.4 119.02 L 552.4 0 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#EBFFFF;" fill="#EBFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 15.75 0 L 15.75 119.02 L 552.4 119.02 L 552.4 0 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 35.43 47.79)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:35.94em;--ltx-fo-height:4.29em;--ltx-fo-depth:2.6em;font-size:10pt;" height="95.4" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 59.42)" width="497.31"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.F24.pic1.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:35.94em;">
<span id="A6.F24.pic1.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F24.pic1.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#4DFFFF;">Round 1: General Overview</span>  <span id="A6.F24.pic1.p2.pic1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFA64D;">Semantic Weight: 0.1
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:5.7pt;"></span></span>
<span id="A6.F24.pic1.p2.pic1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F24.pic1.p2.pic1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">"I’m writing an article about renewable energy sources. Could you provide an overview of the main types of renewable energy, such as solar, wind, and hydroelectric power, and their respective benefits?"</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</span>
<span id="A6.F24.pic1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.F24.pic1.p3.pic1" class="ltx_picture" color="#000000" height="119.02" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 552.4 119.02" width="552.4"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,119.02) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#66FFFF;" fill="#66FFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 119.02 L 552.4 119.02 L 552.4 0 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#E0FFFF;" fill="#E0FFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 15.75 0 L 15.75 119.02 L 552.4 119.02 L 552.4 0 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 35.43 47.79)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:35.94em;--ltx-fo-height:4.29em;--ltx-fo-depth:2.6em;font-size:10pt;" height="95.4" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 59.42)" width="497.31"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.F24.pic1.p3.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:35.94em;">
<span id="A6.F24.pic1.p3.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F24.pic1.p3.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#4DFFFF;">Round 2: Specific Focus</span>  <span id="A6.F24.pic1.p3.pic1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFA64D;">Semantic Weight: 0.3
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:5.7pt;"></span></span>
<span id="A6.F24.pic1.p3.pic1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F24.pic1.p3.pic1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">"I’d like to dive deeper into solar energy. Can you explain the key technologies involved in solar energy production, like photovoltaic cells and concentrated solar power systems, and discuss how they work?"</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</span>
<span id="A6.F24.pic1.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.F24.pic1.p4.pic1" class="ltx_picture" color="#000000" height="135.62" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 552.4 135.62" width="552.4"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,135.62) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#4DFFFF;" fill="#4DFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 135.62 L 552.4 135.62 L 552.4 0 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#D6FFFF;" fill="#D6FFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 15.75 0 L 15.75 135.62 L 552.4 135.62 L 552.4 0 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 35.43 64.39)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:35.94em;--ltx-fo-height:4.29em;--ltx-fo-depth:3.8em;font-size:10pt;" height="112" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 59.42)" width="497.31"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.F24.pic1.p4.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:35.94em;">
<span id="A6.F24.pic1.p4.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F24.pic1.p4.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#4DFFFF;">Round 3: Application Context</span>  <span id="A6.F24.pic1.p4.pic1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFA64D;">Semantic Weight: 0.6
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:5.7pt;"></span></span>
<span id="A6.F24.pic1.p4.pic1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F24.pic1.p4.pic1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">"One of the challenges of renewable energy is energy storage. Could you provide examples of advanced storage technologies, such as lithium-ion batteries and grid-scale storage systems, and explain their role in ensuring the reliability of renewable energy?"</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</span>
<span id="A6.F24.pic1.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.F24.pic1.p5.pic1" class="ltx_picture" color="#000000" height="119.02" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 552.4 119.02" width="552.4"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,119.02) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#33FFFF;" fill="#33FFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 119.02 L 552.4 119.02 L 552.4 0 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#CCFFFF;" fill="#CCFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 15.75 0 L 15.75 119.02 L 552.4 119.02 L 552.4 0 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 35.43 47.79)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:35.94em;--ltx-fo-height:4.29em;--ltx-fo-depth:2.6em;font-size:10pt;" height="95.4" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 59.42)" width="497.31"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
