<span id="A6.F24.pic1.p5.pic1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F24.pic1.p5.pic1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">"Looking toward the future, what are the emerging innovations in renewable energy technologies, such as perovskite solar cells or hydrogen fuel cells, and how might they address current limitations in efficiency and scalability?"</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
