<span id="A6.F24.pic1.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.F24.pic1.p6.pic1" class="ltx_picture" color="#000000" height="102.42" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 552.4 102.42" width="552.4"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,102.42) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#DF809F;" fill="#DF809F" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 102.42 L 552.4 102.42 L 552.4 0 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9E6EC;" fill="#F9E6EC" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 15.75 0 L 15.75 102.42 L 552.4 102.42 L 552.4 0 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 35.43 14.5)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:35.94em;--ltx-fo-height:5.5em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="78.79" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 76.1)" width="497.31"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.F24.pic1.p6.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:35.94em;">
<span id="A6.F24.pic1.p6.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F24.pic1.p6.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#D24D79;">• PATTERN EVALUATION
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:5.7pt;"></span>This pattern progresses from a broad overview to detailed, real-world applications and advanced insights. The prompts are designed to elicit informative and well-structured responses, ensuring a comprehensive understanding of the topic through systematic knowledge building.</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</span></span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 24: </span>Information pattern demonstrating systematic knowledge acquisition from broad renewable energy overview to cutting-edge technological innovations and future applications.</figcaption>
</figure>
